 "message": "Here is what company policy says. Expenses (POL-EXP-01): Submit expenses in the HR portal within 30 days, with a receipt for anything over $25. Meals while travelling are covered up to $75 per day. Your manager approves expenses; a single expense over $1,000 also needs your department head. Alcohol is not reimbursed unless it is part of an approved client event. Business travel (POL-TRV-01): Book flights and hotels through the travel desk at least 14 days ahead where possible. Economy class for flights under 6 hours; premium economy is allowed for longer flights. Travel needs your manager's approval before booking.",
 "cited_policy_ids": [
  "POL-EXP-01",
  "POL-TRV-01"
 ]
}
